@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

# =============================================================
#  HttpClient in .NET 10: calling outside A-P-I's
#  Start the API (Ctrl+F5), send each request, then watch the logs.
#  Holidays A-P-I : https://date.nager.at/      (no key)
#  SMS gateway    : https://postman-echo.com/   (echoes what we send)
# =============================================================

### HC1. Public holidays for the UK: 200 OK with a list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/holidays/2026/GB

### HC2. India: the A-P-I has no data, 204 No Content
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/holidays/2026/IN

### HC3. A country code that does not exist: 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/holidays/2026/XX

### HC4. Log in (the reminder endpoint needs a token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sara.ahmed@example.com",
  "password": "Clinic2026!"
}

### HC5. Register a patient
# @name patient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Imran",
  "lastName": "Qureshi",
  "dateOfBirth": "1987-09-03",
  "gender": "Male",
  "maritalStatus": "Married",
  "nationalityCode": "IN",
  "identityType": "Passport",
  "identityNumber": "P{{$randomInt 1000000 9999999}}",
  "mobileNumber": "+9198{{$randomInt 10000000 99999999}}",
  "address": { "line1": "5 Charminar Road", "city": "Hyderabad" }
}

### HC6. Send a reminder SMS: see the headers and body the gateway received
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patient.response.body.$.id}}/reminders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### HC7. The gateway is down (503): watch the retries in the logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/gateway-status/503
